    /* Phones. The report had no narrow rules at all: a fixed 300px rating column beside the stats, charts
       that refused to shrink below 400px and three fixed-width columns per feedback row, so on a 390px
       screen every card hung past the right edge (found by the UI sweep's clipped-edge check, 2026-09-17). */
